WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Maḓi a mvula a elela a tshi bva kha mutombo, a dzhena kha gatara.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Neṱe i fara maṱari, maḓi a fhira.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Maḓi a u thoma a na buse ḽa mutombo. A ḓadza phaiphi yo imaho.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Bola i gonya ya vala phaiphi. Maḓi a tevhelaho a dzhena thanngini yo valwaho.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Musi thanngi yo ḓala, maḓi a fhiraho a elela besenini ḽa muri, kule na luvhondo.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Nga murahu ha mvula, bvisani maḓi phaiphini uri i lugele mvula i tevhelaho.
